@robertlperry Acctually we have began this task on local, and now is under testing process, We have completed a detailed comparison of this patch set.
The platform-specific changes for w6510/w6520/w6920/w6940 are the parts currently missing in our branch; the remaining changes are largely aligned between both sides.
We are now validating the Trixie-related updates using the community test cases. Once validation is complete, we will submit the corresponding changes to the community as a PR, that PR will include all your chagnes , together with some other updating such as bug fixing, and will mention the link in this PR once that PR is raised . thanks once again,
